<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Kolosaayi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Muhanda a Pahuli huli bisu Kolosaayi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kolosaayi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kol</para>
  <para style="mt2">Muhanda a Pahuli huli bisu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kolosaayi</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili</para>
  <para style="ip">Kolosaayi musyenge wu baatuunga hu tsyelo a Wesete a Asiya, wu bali mu uteele tsi ya Turikiya lolo yiniiyi. Pahuli peleve a hayamono libundu li musyenge mo wuuna ve. Wu atelimisi libundu mo liina Epafasi, mumosi mu bambaahi ba nde ba isalu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 1:7">1.7</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:12">4.12</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Pahuli ayuhi ti ndongisili yi mapfuta yaakoti mu libundu la Kolosaayi. Bo baakava ndongisili yi yaasobohono na Musamu wu Mubwe wa Yisu Kristo. Baatu mo baana baakahwadisa Bamukristo ba Kolosaayi mu ukangama mu bukulu bwa bo, na ubaakuunda matwala makima, ma mali mu utuma tsi. Ka bu Pahuli ali mu kondaayi, nde utwala uyamonehele na bo ve. Mono buni nde hasonihili bo muhanda mo wunuuwu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Muhanda huli bisu Kolosaayi li mu umweese ifwaani hya Kristo, nde wuuna wu Nzambi haasoolo na haatsindaha mu uyobolo baatu. Hu musyenge a Kolosaayi, baatu na boomo bu matwala ma baavelemono, ka mo mali mu utuma tsi. Kaahu, <char style="em">Kristo ni wu afulala matwala mo maana mifudi</char>. Mu kwili a nde ŋa kuruwa, nde amaasi mifudi mi matwala mo maana mu baatu. Bu nde haasiidi buuna, Nzambi afutili moonyi wu li mu Kristo Mwana a nde, mu ba baasumaha. Kristo li kaka mutswe libundu, li lili we nyutu yi baatuunga mu banga imiinu boosi. Nde li mukuutu a banga imiinu, wu li mu umweese bo nzila mu ndyatili yi nyatihi. Mu tondihili, banga imiinu bali itwadi na Kristo, mu kwili a nde na moonyi a nde. Bo baamiikituha baatu ba banyatihi.</para>
  <para style="io1">Mu ibadi hyatsomi hi muhanda (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 1:1-2:5">1.1–2.5</ref></char>), mukuunga mumosi li mu uyuusa <char style="em">Kristo wu li Pfumu a tsi na wu libundu</char> (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 1:15-20">1.15-20</ref></char>). Tswamina mukuunga mo wuuna, hu li na lisambulu mu bisu Kolosaayi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 1:3-14">1.3-14</ref></char>). Humbisa mukuunga mo wuuna, Pahuli li mu uyibuhala moonyi mu mukonono a nde mu uhwadisa libundu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 1:24-2:5">1.24–2.5</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">Titswene, Pahuli li mu uleele huli Bamukristo ba Kolosaayi mu ukebe (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 2:6-23">2.6-23</ref></char>). Bo a baafwana uyuha ndongisili yi yili mu ubita mu undunga ve, ka mu ukwilala mu imiinu hi bo baayaka.</para>
  <para style="io1">Mu usukasa, nde li mu uva mandoongi mu uhwada <char style="em">mu idiingu hi inyatihi</char> hutso libundu, hutso a ibaandu na hutso a bula (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 3:1-4:6">3.1–4.6</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">Muhanda li mu usuka mu mabwehe (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 4:7-18">4.7-18</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngu musamu a muhanda a Pahuli huli bisu Kolosaayi, kini na tsalu natee lolo yiniiyi. Kristo li mu uyobolo baatu mu mavupu ma mabi. Nde li mu uyobolo bo kaka, mu moosi ma muutwala ulwanisa itwadi ŋa hati la baatu na utahusa bo.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mabwehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Me Pahuli, wu li iluumbi hya Kristo Yisu mu litondo la Nzambi, itwadi na mwana a ngu a bisu Timoteho.<verse eid="COL 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />Bisu lili mu usonehele huli banga imiinu ba bali hu musyenge a Kolosaayi, baana ba ngu ba ngetetee mu Nzambi, mu itwadi hya na Kristo. Nyaha Nzambi Taata a bisu ava benu hyese na hyenze!<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lisambulu la pfutili matondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />Bisu libaafutala matondo tangu yoosi huli Nzambi, Taata a Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo, ŋa bisu libaasambila mu benu. <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />Mu mbuli, bisu laayuha tsangu yi imiinu hya benu mu Kristo Yisu, na litondo li benu lili na lo mu boosi ba bali bangidi. <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />Benu lili mu usingama mu hiitu hi baamiiswehele benu hu mayulu. Hiitu hi baamayabisa benu, ni dyambu la mbuli, li lili Musamu wu Mubwe, wu atoodi natee huli benu. <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />Musamu wu Mubwe mo wunuuwu, li mu utsamuha mu tsi yoosi. Nde li mu ubuta mbutu we bu nde hasa mu benu, umata ilumbu hi benu laayuhi baatu yuha latsomi, mu utoyo mu hyese hya Nzambi. Hyese mo hiina, ni hi benu laasoolo mu imbuli hyoosi. <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />Epafasi, mbaahi a bisu a tsoongo wu isalu wu afulala litondo, ava benu ndongisili mo yiina. Nde li mu usala mu benu we musalili a ngetetee wa Kristo. <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />Nde ayabisi bisu, ki litondo Livupu la Ngidi laava benu.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Ni mu buuna, umata ilumbu hi bisu laayuhi lo, bisu a laakolo usambila mu benu ve. Bisu lili mu uvondo huli Nzambi, mana nde aluusa benu mu nzaabili yoosi ya bi nde haatondo, na tsiki yoosi, na buyedi bu Livupu. <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />Buuna, benu luutwala udyata bu hwafwana ŋa busu bwa Pfumu, mana nde abaamono kinya mu pasi vaanga la benu. Benu luukasa mavaanga ma benu moosi mu bukuhu, na benu luukula mu nzaabili a Nzambi. <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />Sa bahwadisa benu mu matwala ma nde, we bu hu li mifudi mi muyusu a nde, mana benu likuunda moosi na mukami. <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />Baafutalaani matondo huli Nzambi Taata na kinya yoosi. Nde wu ava benu matwala ma ubaha kabu li mukobe wu nde haswehele bangidi, mu ukwilala hutso liyalala. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Nde ayobolo bisu hu tsina matwala ma piipidi, na abita bisu hutso Ipfumu hya Mwana a nde wu litondo. <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />Ni mu nde bisu laamiiyoboho mu ma mabi, na masumu ma bisu baamiinyahula.<verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristo ŋa mutswe a byosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Kristo ni ifwaani hya Nzambi wu baavelemono. Nde ni Mwana watsomi ŋa hati la baatu, na wu alutahala byosi bi Nzambi haavaanga<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 8:32-36">Mak 8.32-36</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:1-3">Yow 1.1-3</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />Mu tooni ati, ni mu nde Nzambi haavaanga byosi hu mayulu na ŋa toto:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:16">Bi bubaamono na bi bubaavelemono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:16">bipfumu bi bili na matwala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="COL 1:16">banga matwala na banga lituma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:16">Nzambi avaanga byosi mu nde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="COL 1:16">na mu tooni a nde.<verse eid="COL 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />Nde atswamini bisiha byosi, na mu tooni a nde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="COL 1:17">byosi bi baavaanga byakwelene ŋa mbuha a byo.<verse eid="COL 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Nde ni mutswe a nyutu, yi yili libundu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:18">Nde ni mbandu a moonyi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:18">Nde ni watsomi wu asuuhi ŋa hati la babaakwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="COL 1:18">mana nde abaha mbuha yatsomi mu byosi.<verse eid="COL 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Nzambi avoli kesili yi uba nde woosi mu Mwana a nde, <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />na mu Mwana a nde, Nzambi atondi unongese byosi na nde mwakulu. Ni mu Kristo wu apalisi makila ma nde ŋa kuruwa, Nzambi haasiidi hyenze mu baatu boosi ŋa toto, we hu mayulu.<verse eid="COL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Benu kaka, benu laaba laatahuha na Nzambi hutsomi, bu benu laaba baboho ba nde mu tooni bubi boosi, bu benu laakatsima na laakavaanga. <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />Ka bunuubu, mu lipfu li musunya la Mwana a nde, Nzambi miinongese benu na nde. Nde haasiidi buuna, mana benu limonehele baatu bangidi ŋa busu bwa nde, we baatu ba baavele na ipiha na masyembo. <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />Ni buuna, benu laafwana ukwilala mu imiinu, na uba ba baakangama mu yulu bibeene bi byabama, hwavele utahuha na hiitu hya benu, umata ŋa benu laayuhi Musamu wu Mubwe. Musamu wu Mubwe mo wunuuwu, baayabisi huli byosi bi Nzambi haavaangi, bi bili hu tsina a yulu. Ni me Pahuli, aka musalili.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukonono a Pahuli mu uhwadisa libundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Bunuubu, me ndi na kinya mu mapasi ma me ndi mu umono mu tooni a benu. Mu tooni ati, me ndi mu ukwada mu umono mapasi mu nyutu a me, mana me kumbasa libundu li lili nyutu a Kristo, na umanisala mapasi ma nde moosi. <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />Me aka musalili a libundu, we bu hu li tumili yi Nzambi hava me mu tooni a benu. Nde atuma me mu uyabisa benu Musamu a Nzambi bu hwafwana. <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />Musamu mo, ni matswehi ma liyobolo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 4:11">Mak 4.11</ref> </char></note> ma nde haaba haaswehe umata beleve, huli baatu ba tsi yoosi. Ka nde amiiyabisa matswehi mo huli buli la nde mu tangu mo yiniiyi. <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />Mu bubwe bwa nde, Nzambi atondi uyabisa huli mabuli makima moosi, ki pila busina buli mu tswehi a nde yi liyobolo! Tswehi mo ni yiniiyi: Kristo li mu benu, na nde li mu uva benu hiitu hi ubaha kabu mu muyusu a Nzambi. <verse eid="COL 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Ni mu buuna, bisu lili mu uyabisa Kristo huli baatu boosi. Bisu lili mu ukebese na ulongese pasi muutu na tsiki yoosi, mana pasi muutu aba wu asupaha mu itwadi na Kristo. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Ni mu buuna, me ndi mu utsala na ulwana na mifudi mi mili mu umata huli Kristo, wu li mu usala mu me mu matwala moosi.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Ni mu buuna, me tondi ti benu liyaaba bunene bu mudiingu wu me ndi mu undwana mu tooni a benu, na mu tooni a bisu Lawodise na mu tooni a boosi ba bakini a baamoni hiinzi hya me ve. <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />Me tondi ti mitima mya bo miluula mu ibahala, mana bo baaba itwadi mu litondo. Me tondi ti bo baluula mu busina bwa hiitu hi hibaamata mu nzaabili a mbuli, mana bo bayaaba tswehi yi liyobolo la Nzambi. Tswehi mo, ni Kristo nde mwakulu. <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />Mu nde siha, hwasweme busina bwosi bwa tsiki na bwa nzaabili a Nzambi. <verse eid="COL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Me ndi mu undeele benu lo, mana pasi muutu aveledungasa benu mu bileedi bya soho. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Tso me peli na benu mu musunya, me ndi na benu mu matsimi. Na me ndi na kinya mu umono benu mu uhwada, na uba ba baabama mu imiinu hi benu lili na hyo mu Kristo.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukangama mu Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Ni mu buuna, bu benu laayaka Kristo Yisu we Pfumu a benu, baani ba laakangama mu nde mu idiingu hya benu. <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />Menaani manganzi mu nde na tungaani idiingu hya benu hyoosi mu nde. Baani likanda mu imiinu, we bu hu li ndongisili yi benu laayaka, na baafutalaani matondo ma malahi huli Nzambi.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Kelaani muutu a hapfuta benu mu mikuma mya soho, mi mapfuta na mi myavele lisuunga. Mikuma mi myateleme ŋa yulu bukulu bwa baatu, na ŋa yulu a ndongisili a baandu ya baatu ba tsi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ndongisili a baandu ya baatu ba tsi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">bakima bali mu uleele: «matwala ma mavupu ma mabi ma ŋa tsi» </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:20">2.20</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 4:3">Ngl 4.3</ref>.</char></note>, ka a mu Kristo ve. <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Mu tooni ati, Nzambi li, nde woosi mutso a nyutu a Kristo. <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />Na ni mu nde benu laayaka byosi mu iteesi hi hyakuha. Nde li pfumu a pasi lituma na pasi matwala.<verse eid="COL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Mu itwadi hya na nde, baaketi benu. Ka a mu ketili a myoho mya baatu ve, ka ketili yi yaamata huli Kristo. Na nde li mu uyobolo bisu mu ma mali mu ubita bisu mu masumu. <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />Ni mu buuna, ŋa baatondihi benu, baadiihi benu na Kristo, mana benu lisuuha kaka na nde mu babaakwa. Mu tooni ati, benu laamiisa imiinu mu matwala ma Nzambi ma maasuuli nde ŋa hati la babaakwa. <verse eid="COL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Hutsomi, benu laaba we ba baakwa mu tooni bubi bwa benu. Benu laaba ba baavelekete, bangoyi. Ka bunuubu, Nzambi miifutala benu moonyi na Kristo. Bu nde haasiidi buuna, nde amiinyahula bubi bwa bisu a benu bwosi. <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />Nde amiifwinzala muhanda mikele wu akakese bisu, mikele mi myaakabelese bisu. Nde amiikasula muhanda mo wuuna, na ukomene nde ŋa kuruwa. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Ni buuna nde avudimisi mifudi na mavupu bya banga lituma na banga matwala. Nde amweesi bo tsonyi ŋa kuungi la baatu, bu nde haabiti bo we bakondayi mutso a koonge a mbiingili a Mwana a nde.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Buuna, a lisiingasa pasi muutu atsundasa benu mu bidiili bya benu ve, tso binywili bya benu; buuve mu kiinzili mikungi mya mbihili a tsuungi, na mi bilumbu bya saba. <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Mambu mo maniima moosi, mali ndulu we binzinza bya ma muuya hu busu. Ka imbuli hili mu Kristo. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />A lisiinga ve ti baatu ba bali mu ubaamonehele we ba bakulamana na ubaasambila bapofi, na ubaava talu yindahi mu tsimi a bo, bapatula pfuta a benu. Baatu ba buuna, baaluula mu nyeme yi butsuudu mu tooni a mbiili a bo yi imuutu. A liyuhala bo ve! <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />Bo a baakangama mu Kristo wu li mutswe ve. Ka ni mu Kristo, nyutu yoosi yili mu ubaha moonyi na yaabaambana mu makede na misasi. Ni buuna nyutu yibaakula we bu Nzambi atondi.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwili na moonyi mu Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Tso benu laakwa na Kristo, benu a lisaali hu tsina a ndongisili a mbaandu ya baatu ba tsi ve. Mu hima benu libaadyata we baatu ba tsi mo yiniiyi, na ubaasiinga ti babaakwiha benu mikele mya we miniimi? <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />Mono ma baatu mo baana bali mu uleele: «A haavolo hiniihi ve», «a biimba hyo ve», «a beembe ve». <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Mikele mo miina mili mu utala bisiha bi byafwana udimbala bu baatu bamiisalila byo. Mu tooni ati, myo mili ndulu matumili na mandongisili ma imuutu. <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Mikele mo miina mili mu umonehele we mya tsiki, mu tooni ati, myo mili mu utuma ukiinza bukulu, mu ukulamana, na ukwamisa nyutu. Ka mikele mya pila yiina, a mili na tsongo tso hoole ve, mu tooni ati, myo utwala uliha baatu mu usa litondo la bo lilibi ve.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Mu tooni ati, benu laamiisuha na Kristo ŋa hati la babaakwa, sahaani bisiha bya hu yulu, hu Kristo hatsahala ŋa mbahala a Nzambi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Mkg 110.1</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Baasahaani bisiha bya hu yulu, ka a bi bili ŋa toto ve. <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />Mu tooni ati benu laamiikwa, na moonyi a benu asweme na Kristo mu Nzambi. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Ŋa Kristo wu li moonyi a benu humonehele, benu kaka sa limonehele na nde hutso muyusu a nde.<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbiili yi kulu na mbiili yi nyatihi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Ni mu buuna, dubaani byosi bya toto bi bili mu nyutu a benu: bumbembo, tsumihili, nyinga, manzala ma mabi, nyungu, mu tooni ati, yo yili kaka kuundili bifwita. <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Ni bubi bwa pila yiina bubaateele kesi a Nzambi [huli baatu ba bubaavelesiingala nde]. <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Yiina aba ni mbiili a benu yi kulu, ŋa idiingu hya benu hyaba hutso lituma li masumu mo maana.<verse eid="COL 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Ka bunuubu, benu kaka timbaani maniima moosi: kesi, fwengili, bukanyi, utuha Nzambi. Dyambu tso limosi la tsonyi livelepala mu munywa a benu. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />A laabaapfutasana, mu tooni ati, benu laamiisiisa imuutu hi ikulu na bipfu bya hyo. <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />Benu laamiilwata imuutu hi inyatihi hi Nzambi wu avaanga bisu ubaabwehwadisa tangu yoosi mu ifwafwani<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Mba 1.26</ref></char></note> hya nde, mana benu liyaaba nde bubwe-bubwe. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />A husaali na lisobosono ve, tso we li ngoyi, tso we li Muyudaayo; buuve wu baakete, tso wu baavelekete; buli la baatu ba baavele a nzaabili, tso mubongo; tso muviha, buuve wu li bunyanga. Hya tsoongo ndulu ni Kristo, nde wu li byosi, mutso a baatu boosi.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Nzambi amiisoolo benu mu uba baatu nde, na nde ubaatondo benu. Ni mu buuna, benu laafwana uba na mutima wu litondo li mifudi, wu ukumbasa bana, wa kulimini, wu bulembo, wu mukami. <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />Benu laafwana ukuunda ndyatili bambaahi. Tso mumosi mu benu li na tooni na mbaahi, hwafwana mu usa bana kolo-kolo, we bu Pfumu haasiidi benu kolo-kolo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:12">Mty 6.12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 6:14">14</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Ka ŋa yulu a maana moosi, baani na litondo, dita mo li luusa ti benu liba mu itwadi hi hyasupaha. <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Nyaha hyenze hya Kristo hiba mu mitima mya benu. Ni mu ukuhasa hyenze mo hiina Nzambi hateele benu, mu uba binama bi byabaambana mu nyutu mosi. Nyaha benu libaafutala matondo! <verse eid="COL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Nyaha mambu ma Kristo mabaha mbuha mu mitima mya benu na busina bwa mo bwosi. Baalongesenaani na baayibusanaani na tsiki yoosi. Yimbalaani Nzambi mu mitima mya benu myosi, na pfutili matondo, mu mikuunga na nyimbu, na nyimbu Livupu. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Byosi bi benu luusa, mu mikuma buuve mu mavaanga, baasaani byosi mu nduhi a Pfumu Yisu mu pfutili matondo mu nde huli Nzambi Taata.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndongisili yi yitali buli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />Benu bakaasu, baani hu tsina lituma li balumi ba benu, we bu hwafwana mu usa, bu lika itwadi na Pfumu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:22">Efe 5.22</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 5:24">24</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="COL 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Benu balumi, baatondwaani bakadi ba benu, na a liba na mitima mi myapiinda ŋa busu bwa bo ve.<verse eid="COL 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Benu baana, baasiingalaani bangu na bataata ba benu mu pasi dyambu, mu tooni ati, maana ni ma Pfumu ubaasilasa.<verse eid="COL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Benu bataata, a laabaakwiisa baana ba benu kesi, mu uvelenyongese bo.<verse eid="COL 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Benu basalili, baasiingalaani bapfumu ba benu ba ŋa toto mu myosi. A laabaakuhasa lo ndulu ŋa busu bwa bo, we ba bali mu usaha umweese kinya huli baatu, ka nyaha lisiingala la benu livangama mu mutima a benu woosi, mu tooni a likiinzu la Pfumu. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Pasi isalu hi benu lili mu usa, baasaani hyo mu mutima a benu woosi, mu tooni a Pfumu, ka a mu tooni a baatu ve. <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />Yibuhalaani moonyi ti, Pfumu uva benu pfuta, ni mukobe wu nde haaswehele buli la nde. Mu tooni ati, Pfumu wa mbuli wu benu lili mu usalila ni Kristo. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Ka pasi muutu wu li mu uvanga bubi, sa ayaka musyendo we bu hu li mavaanga ma nde. Mu tooni ati, Nzambi a hubaasa lisobosono la baatu ve.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Benu bapfumu, baatumaani basalili ba benu mu lisuunga na mu butsiitsa. Yibuhalaani moonyi ti, benu kaka lili na Pfumu hu mayulu.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Matumili ma tsyelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Sambilaani na mukonono; baani likanda na baafutalaani matondo huli Nzambi. <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />Baasambilaani kaka mu bisu, mana Nzambi adibula bisu nzila yi yayelemene mu uta ibila mu mambu ma nde, mu uyabisa tswehi yi liyobolo ya Nzambi, ni Kristo. Yaabaani lo, ni mu tooni mo yiniiyi, me ndi mu kondayi. <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />Bunuubu, sambilaani mana me nzabisa tswehi mo yiina<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:11">Mlk 4.11</ref></char></note> paayalala, we bu hwafwana huli me mu usa yo.<verse eid="COL 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Baani na mbiili ya tsiki ŋa busu bwa boosi ba baavele mu Kristo, mu ulebe bo mu pasi tangu yi yimiimonehele. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Nyaha mambu ma muupala mu minwya mya benu, maba ma mabwe mu uyuha na ma lisuunga. Yaabaani ufutala mvutu huli pasi muutu we bu hwafwana.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mabwehe ma tsyelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />Tisiike<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Mav 20.4</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:21-22">Efe 6.21-22</ref> </char></note>, mwana a ngu wu litondo, mukeelisi libundu wa ngetetee, mbaahi a bisu wu isalu hya Pfumu, sa ayabisa benu moosi mu me. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />Me miitsindaha nde huli benu, mana benu liyaaba bu bisu lili huni, na mana nde ahwadisa benu. <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />Me miitsindaha nde na mwana a ngu wu litondo, wu li wa ngetetee, Onesiime<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:10-15">Fil 10-15</ref></char></note>, musi tsi a benu. Bo sa bayabisa benu moosi ma mali mu uvyoho huni.<verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Arisitake, wu li na me mu kondaayi, tsindihi benu mabwehe, bumosi kaka, Malako, ikuta hya Baranabasi. Benu laamiiyaka tumili mu tooni a nde: nde aya huli benu, yakaani nde bubwe. <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />Yisu, nga kuumbu Yusetuusi, nde kaka tsindihi benu mabwehe. Ndulu ni batatu ba baakete banga imiinu baana, bali mu usala na me mu ipfumu hya Nzambi.<verse eid="COL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Epafasi wu li kaka musi tsi a benu, viidi benu mabwehe. Musalili a Kristo Yisu mo wunuuwu, li mu ubaasambila Nzambi mu benu na mifudi, mana benu liba ba bahwada, ba baayele mu Livupu, na ba baamiivolo kesili yi ukuhasa litondo la Nzambi mu pasi lo. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Me ndi mu utiila nde imbangi mo hiniihi: Nde li mu usala bulahi mu tooni a benu, mu ba bali hu musyenge a Lawodise na ba bali hu musyenge a Hyerapolisi. <verse eid="COL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Luuka, mbaahi a me wu li ngaanga wu afulala litondo, na Demasi baviidi benu mabwehe.<verse eid="COL 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Vaani mabwehe huli baana ba ngu ba bali hu Lawodise, na Niifa, na libundu li libaapfuutana hu nzo a nde. <verse eid="COL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Benu limana utaanga muhanda mo wunuuwu, tsindahaani nde hu libundu la Lawodise, mana bo kaka bataanga nde. Benu kaka, taangaani muhanda wu umata hu Lawodise. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Leelaani huli Arikiipe: «Sa isalu hi baava we mu tooni a Pfumu, na bukuhu.»<verse eid="COL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Mu hooho hwa me mwakulu, me ndi mu utsonehe mikuma mo miniimi: <char style="em">Me Pahuli miipa benu mabwehe.</char> A laabaavusahana ti me mu kondayi me ndi. Nyaha hyese hya Nzambi hiba na benu!<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>